  "title50px-2": "Save time on collection",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-2": "\n            <p>With payment at the kiosks or online, make your customers autonomous and free up your time to focus on your business: catering! </p>\n            <p>Connected to all Innovorder solutions, the cash register becomes the ideal conductor of your business.</p>\n          ",
